    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Neith\nVANCOUVER\nA luxurious\ntrans-Pacific\ncrossing in days\ninstead of weeks...\nwith daylight\nhours for\nsightseeing in\nFiji and Honolulu!\n0\nSAN FRANCISCO\nHONOLULU\nINT\nANATIONAL\nCANTON\nCocame\nDATE\nBIJI\nDINS\nAUSTRALIA\nSouthen\nOcean\nSYDNEY\nAUCKLAND",
      "B.C.P.A. BOOKING OFFICES\nAND GENERAL AGENTS\nAUSTRALIA\nTrans-Australia Airlines,\nHead Office-339 Swanston Street, Melbourne, C.1.\nBooking offices all States.\nNEW ZEALAND\nNew Zealand National Airways Corporation,\nMercantile Chambers, Customs Street East, Auckland;\nwith agencies throughout New Zealand.\nFIJI\nNew Zealand National Airways Corporation,\nSuva and Nandi.\nHAWAII\nTheo. H. Davies \u0026 Co. Limited,\nDavies Building, Honolulu 2.\nU.S.A.\nB.C.P.A. Booking Office,\n21 Grant Street, San Francisco.\nBritish Overseas Airways Corporation:\nNEW YoRK: 420 Madison Ave., New York 17, N.Y.\nAnd in BALTIMORE, CHICAGO, LOS ANGELES,\nWASHINGTON.\nCANADA\nTrans-Canada Airlines,\nHotel Vancouver, Vancouver, B.C.\nOffices in all major cities.\nCall your local travel agent, or book through\nNo booking fee\nBritish Commonwealth\nPacific Airlines\nHead Office: A.P.A. Building, 53 Martin Place,\nSYDNEY\nTelephone BW 2741\nPrinted in Australia",
      "Hy BCPA\nacross the Pacific to\nSan Francisco, Honolulu,\nCanton Island, Fiji,\nAuckland and Sydney."
    ],
